Subject: [PATCH 1306/3799] soh: rename func_808BC9EC ->
 BgTreemouth_HandleChoice

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: on the cutscene's unskippable init it repositions the player, and then either starts gDekuTreeMouthOpeningCs and sets the opened-mouth flag, or falls back to gDekuTreeAskAgainCs and returns to waiting.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Treemouth/z_bg_treemouth.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
